  "description": "LUYBIR crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C98 H130 Eu3 N6 O15 S8,C40 H48 O4 S4,7(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.574-4.750 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.49-166.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C98H130Eu3N6O15S8·C40H48O4S4·7(dmf).",
